      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is largely cargo culted from Ed\u0027s CL. It just covers one of the operations provided by the SYV682X driver, but I plan to add more in a future CL, if the structure and style of this one seem reasonable.",
      "revId": "81574cb1bc2432812cbba70b33961fbc22c6fe72",
