        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-07-01T21:50:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When I change this to syv682x-emul, the test fails an assertion trying to find an emulator with the label SYV682X_EMUL. I can\u0027t figure out why. I already changed the compatible string in zephyr,syv682x.yaml to \"zephyr,syv682-emul\", and that doesn\u0027t seem to have any effect on building or running the test.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 204,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 204,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "81574cb1bc2432812cbba70b33961fbc22c6fe72",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d8e84c6b_11f0d0ee",
        "filename": "zephyr/test/drivers/overlay.dts",
