      },
      "lineNbr": 204,
      "author": {
        "id": 1483403
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-07-01T22:54:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems like this needs to match DT_DRV_COMPAT in zephyr/emul/emul_syv682x.c so maybe adding -emul to both of them, or don\u0027t put emul in. If this was a native driver, you would want the real chip and the emulator to have the same compatible value right?",
      "parentUuid": "a3e28a05_893a5f36",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 204,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 204,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "81574cb1bc2432812cbba70b33961fbc22c6fe72",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8b38dc69_d0b632e4",
        "filename": "zephyr/test/drivers/overlay.dts",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 204,
      "author": {
        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-07-01T23:02:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My intuition was that the emulator should have the same compatible string as the real device, i.e. no \"-emul.\" But in Ed\u0027s CL, it was suggested that the \"-emul\" be added based on upstream practices. So I gave it a shot.",
      "parentUuid": "d8e84c6b_11f0d0ee",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 204,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 204,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "81574cb1bc2432812cbba70b33961fbc22c6fe72",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "ec0eb569_01a87108",
        "filename": "zephyr/test/drivers/overlay.dts",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 204,
      "author": {
        "id": 1212794
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-07-01T23:10:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yep, you need to also change DT_DRV_COMPAT but confusingly the \"-\" changes to \"_\", see my change here:\n\nhttps://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/2961272/2..3/zephyr/emul/emul_pi3usb9201.c#6",
      "parentUuid": "d8e84c6b_11f0d0ee",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 204,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 204,
        "endChar": 30
      },
      "revId": "81574cb1bc2432812cbba70b33961fbc22c6fe72",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "78807c86_d4cc80ad",
        "filename": "zephyr/test/drivers/overlay.dts",
        "patchSetId": 4
